    {cancelPlan && <Modal title="停用排课计划" onClose={() => {setCancelPlan(null);setSubmitError("");}} footer={<><button className="exp-button" disabled={busy} onClick={() => setCancelPlan(null)}>保留计划</button><button type="submit" form="exp-stop-plan" className="exp-button exp-danger" disabled={busy}>{busy ? "正在停用…" : "停用未来安排"}</button></>}><div className="exp-confirm-summary"><h3>{cancelPlan.name}</h3><p>仅停止尚未开课的安排，取消相关预约并释放冻结课时；已有上课历史保留。</p></div><form id="exp-stop-plan" className="exp-form" onSubmit={async event => {event.preventDefault();const values=new FormData(event.currentTarget);if(await act("schedule.cancel",{id:cancelPlan.id,reason:values.get("reason")})){setCancelPlan(null);setSubmitError("");notify("计划已停用，未开始的安排及相关冻结课时已释放。");}else setSubmitError("停用未完成，请核对提示后重试。");}}><label className="exp-field full">停用原因<textarea name="reason" required maxLength={300} placeholder="说明本次停止未来安排的原因"/></label></form>{submitError && <p className="exp-error" role="alert">{submitError}</p>}</Modal>}
