    {modal === "invite" && !isCoach && !solo && <Modal title="新增门店教练档案" onClose={closeModal} footer={<><button className="exp-button" onClick={closeModal}>取消</button><button disabled={busy} className="exp-button exp-primary" type="submit" form="exp-invite-form">{busy ? "保存中…" : "保存教练档案"}</button></>}><div className="exp-notice" style={{ marginBottom: 20 }}><UserPlus size={15} /><span>填写教练档案中使用的手机号，审核有效资质后，将本店团队码分享给教练。教练在小程序「加入连锁门店」填写该手机号和团队码，匹配档案后加入，无需开通密码账号。电脑后台账号可按需另行开通。证书有效期请按原文填写。</span></div><form id="exp-invite-form" className="exp-form" onSubmit={inviteCoach}><label className="exp-field">教练姓名<input name="name" required maxLength={20} placeholder="输入姓名" /></label><label className="exp-field">手机号码<input name="phone" type="tel" required pattern="1[3-9][0-9]{9}" placeholder="11 位手机号码" /></label><label className="exp-field full">擅长领域<input name="specialty" required maxLength={40} placeholder="例如：力量训练 / 普拉提" /></label><label className="exp-field full">资质证书名称<input name="certificate" required maxLength={60} placeholder="例如：NASM 国际私人教练认证" /></label><label className="exp-field full">证书实际有效期（按证书原文填写）<ExperienceDatePicker name="expiresAt" aria-label="证书实际有效期" required min={today()} aria-describedby="exp-certificate-note"/><small id="exp-certificate-note">请与原始证书上的到期日期保持一致。</small></label></form>{submitError && <p className="exp-error" role="alert">{submitError}</p>}</Modal>}
